## sn46.5
sn46.5:1.1 | S: At Sāvatthī. | T: At Savatthī.
sn46.5:1.2 | S: Then a mendicant went up to the Buddha … and asked him, | T: Then a certain bhikkhu approached the Blessed One … and said to him:
sn46.5:1.3 | S: “Sir, they speak of the ‘awakening factors’. | T: “Venerable sir, it is said,
