sn46.5:1.8 | S: As they develop the seven awakening factors, their mind is freed from the defilements of sensuality, desire to be reborn, and ignorance. | T: While one is developing these seven factors of enlightenment, one’s mind is liberated from the taint of sensuality, from the taint of existence, from the taint of ignorance.
