## sn47.15
sn47.15:1.1 | S: At Sāvatthī. | T: At Savatthi.
sn47.15:1.2 | S: Then Venerable Bāhiya went up to the Buddha, bowed, sat down to one side, and said to him: | T: Then the Venerable Bahiya approached the Blessed One, paid homage to him, sat down to one side, and said to him:
